(5040, '「極楽とんぼ」とは、事の重大さに気づかず、のんきに構えている人のことをあざけて言う言葉です。でも、今では芸人さんのコンビ名としてしか知らない人がほとんどですね。', 'Gokuraku Tombo (dragonfly in paradise) is a term used to mockingly describe people who are unaware of the seriousness of a situation and take it lightly. However nowadays, most people only know it as the comedy duo''s name.', 54, '{"Ja": "「極楽とんぼ」とは、事の重大さに気づかず、のんきに構えている人のことをあざけて言う言葉です。でも、今では芸人さんのコンビ名としてしか知らない人がほとんどですね。", "En": "Gokuraku Tombo (dragonfly in paradise) is a term used to mockingly describe people who are unaware of the seriousness of a situation and take it lightly. However nowadays, most people only know it as the comedy duo''s name.", "Level": 54, "SourceVocabulary": [{"SubjectId": 5040, "Characters": "極楽"}, {"SubjectId": 3082, "Characters": "事"}, {"SubjectId": 3508, "Characters": "気付く"}, {"SubjectId": 5396, "Characters": "構える"}, {"SubjectId": 4885, "Characters": "居る"}, {"SubjectId": 2475, "Characters": "人"}, {"SubjectId": 8918, "Characters": "鮭"}, {"SubjectId": 2838, "Characters": "言う"}, {"SubjectId": 7492, "Characters": "言葉"}, {"SubjectId": 2593, "Characters": "今"}, {"SubjectId": 3724, "Characters": "芸人"}, {"SubjectId": 3501, "Characters": "名"}, {"SubjectId": 9180, "Characters": "する"}, {"SubjectId": 8697, "Characters": "知る"}, {"SubjectId": 9213, "Characters": "ほとんど"}], "KanjiInSentence": [{"SubjectId": 1340, "Characters": "極"}, {"SubjectId": 704, "Characters": "楽"}, {"SubjectId": 708, "Characters": "事"}, {"SubjectId": 735, "Characters": "重"}, {"SubjectId": 453, "Characters": "大"}, {"SubjectId": 548, "Characters": "気"}, {"SubjectId": 1263, "Characters": "構"}, {"SubjectId": 444, "Characters": "人"}, {"SubjectId": 593, "Characters": "言"}, {"SubjectId": 750, "Characters": "葉"}, {"SubjectId": 497, "Characters": "今"}, {"SubjectId": 916, "Characters": "芸"}, {"SubjectId": 544, "Characters": "名"}, {"SubjectId": 631, "Characters": "知"}], "Morphemes": [{"SubjectId": null, "CombinedForm": null, "surface": "「", "conjugation_type": "*", "conjugation_form": "*", "lemma_readin